{"id":"6c18becc0027ac30","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-set11-hereditary-size-class.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Hereditary Size Class","display":"df-zfc-set11-hereditary-size-class — ZFC Set11 Hereditary Size Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-hereditary-size-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-hereditary-size-class"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-hereditary-size-class — ZFC Set11 Hereditary Size Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-class]]","[[58-df-transitive-closure]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-hereditary-size-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-hereditary-size-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-hereditary-size-class — ZFC Set11 Hereditary Size Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"58-df-transitive-closure\">58-df-transitive-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> is a definable-class parameter and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"58-df-transitive-closure\">58-df-transitive-closure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11HereditarySizeClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11HereditarySizeClass}_S\\)</span> is the class predicate schema defined here</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S(H)\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a> 的可定义类元语言模式解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in V\">\\(\\forall x\\in V\\)</span> 量化集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 不被当作对象语言集合变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}size\\text{-}class} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcSet11HereditarySizeClass}_S(H,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(H)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in H\\leftrightarrow|\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})|&lt;\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}size\\text{-}class} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcSet11HereditarySizeClass}_S(H,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(H)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in H\\leftrightarrow|\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})|&lt;\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary hereditary size definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-closure","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{